msgstr "S26: आँखा जुधेको खण्डमा, तुरुन्त थोरै पानी सफा गर्नुहोस् र औषधी उपचार खोजी गर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:179
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S27: Take off immediately all contaminated clothing"
msgstr "S27: सबै दूषित कपडा तुरुन्त फुकाल्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:180
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S28: After contact with skin, wash immediately with plenty of ... ( to be "
"specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr ""
"S28: छालाको स्पर्श पछि, तुरून्त थोरै पानीले धुनुहोस् ... (उत्पाकले निर्दिष्ट गरिनुपर्ने )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:181
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S29: Do not empty into drains"
msgstr "S29: नाली खाली नगर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:182
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S30: Never add water to this product"
msgstr "S30: यो वस्तुमा पानी कहिल्यै नथप्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:183
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S33: Take precautionary measures against static discharges"
msgstr "S33: स्थिर उन्मोचनका विरूद्ध सुरक्षित मापनहरू लिनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:184
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S35: This material and its container must be disposed of in a safe way"
msgstr "S35: यो सामग्री र यसको कन्टेनर सुरक्षित ठाउँमा फ्यकिनुपर्दछ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:185
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S36: Wear suitable protective clothing"
msgstr "S36: अनुकूल सुरक्षित कपडा लगाउनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:186
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S37: Wear suitable gloves"
msgstr "S37: अनुकूल पञ्जा लगाउनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:187
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S38: In case of insufficient ventilation wear suitable respiratory equipment"
msgstr "S38: हावा जाने ठाउँ अपर्याप्त भएमा श्वास लिने अनुकूल सामग्री लिनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:188
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S39: Wear eye/face protection"
msgstr "S39: आँखा/अनुहार सुरक्षा लगाउनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:189
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S40: To clean the floor and all objects contaminated by this material "
"use ... ( to be specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr ""
"S40: यो सामग्रीद्वारा दूषित गरिएको सबै वस्तु र फ्लोर सफा गर्न ... प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ( जुन "
"उत्पादकद्वारा निर्दिष्ट गरिनुपर्छ )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:190
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S41: In case of fire and/or explosion do not breathe fumes"
msgstr "S41: आगोलागी र/वा विस्फोटक हुँदा धुँवामा श्वास नफेर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:191
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S42: During fumigation/spraying wear suitable respiratory equipment "
"( appropriate wording to be specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr ""
"S42: धुम्रीकरण/स्प्रेइङ हुँदा श्वासप्रश्वास सम्बन्धि अनुकूल सामग्री लगाउनुहोस्( उत्पादकले "
"निर्दिष्ट गर्नुभएको उपयुक्त शब्द )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:192
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S43: In case of fire use ... ( indicate in the space the precise type of "
"fire-fighting equipment. If water increases the risk add - Never use water )"
msgstr ""
"S43: आगोको केसमा ... प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ( आगो-निभाउने सामग्रीको वास्तविक प्रकार खाली "
"स्थानमा इङ्कित गर्नुहोस् । यदि पानीले जोखिम थप्दछ भने - पानी कहिल्यै प्रयोग नगर्नुहोस् )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:193
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S45: In case of accident or if you feel unwell seek medical advice "
"immediately ( show the label where possible )"
msgstr ""
"S45: दुर्घटनाको केसमा वा यदि तपाईँ अस्वस्थ महशुस गर्नुहुन्छ भने तुरुन्त औषधी उपचार खोजी "
"गर्नुहोस् ( सम्भव भएको ठाउँमा लेबुल देखाउनुहोस् )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:194
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S46: If swallowed, seek medical advice immediately and show this container "
"or label"
msgstr ""
"S46: यदि गला बसेमा, तुरुन्त औषधी उपचार खोजी गर्नुहोस् र यो कन्टेनर वा लेबुल देखाउनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:195
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S47: Keep at temperature not exceeding ... °C ( to be specified by the "
"manufacturer )"
msgstr "S47: तापक्रम बढाएर नराख्नुहोस् ... °C ( उत्पादकले निर्दिष्ट गर्नुपर्ने)"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:196
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S48: Keep wet with ... ( appropriate material to be specified by the "
"manufacturer )"
msgstr "S48: यससँग चिसो राख्नुहोस् ... ( उत्पादकले निर्दिष्ट गरेको उपयुक्त सामग्री )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:197
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S49: Keep only in the original container"
msgstr "S49: मौलिक कन्टेनर मात्र राख्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:198
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S50: Do not mix with ... ( to be specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr "S50: यससँग नमिसाउनुहोस् ... ( उत्पादकद्वारा निर्दिष्ट गरिनुपर्ने )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:199
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S51: Use only in well-ventilated areas"
msgstr "S51: राम्रोसँग हावा जाने क्षेत्र मात्र प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:200
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S52: Not recommended for interior use on large surface areas"
msgstr "S52: ठूलो सतह क्षेत्रमा आन्तरीक प्रयोगका लागि सिफारिस गरिएको छैन"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:201
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S53: Avoid exposure - obtain special instructions before use"
msgstr "S53: विवरण छोड्नुहोस् - प्रयोग गर्नु अघि विशेष प्रशिक्षण प्राप्त गर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:202
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S56: Dispose of this material and its container at hazardous or special "
"waste collection point"
msgstr ""
"S56: यो सामग्रीको समाप्ति र जोखिममा वा विशेषमा यसको कन्टेनरले सङ्कलन बिन्दु खेर फाल्छ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:203
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S57: Use appropriate containment to avoid environmental contamination"
msgstr "S57: परिवेशीय सम्मिश्रण त्यग्न उपयुक्त सम्मिश्रण प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:204
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S59: Refer to manufacturer/supplier for information on recovery/recycling"
msgstr ""
"S59: पुन: प्राप्ति/पुनर्चक्रणमा जानकारीका लागि उत्पादक/आपूर्तीकर्तालाई सन्दर्भ गर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:205
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S60: This material and its container must be disposed of as hazardous waste"
msgstr "S60: यो सामग्री र यसको कन्टेनर खतरानाक क्षयको रुपमा फालिनुपर्छ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:206
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S61: Avoid release to the environment. Refer to special instructions/safety "
"data sheet"
msgstr ""
"S61: परिवेशमा निस्कासन त्यागनुहोस् । विशेष प्रशिक्षण/सुरक्षित डेटा पानामा सन्दर्भ गर्नुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:207
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S62: If swallowed, do not induce vomiting: seek medical advice immediately "
"and show this container or label"
msgstr ""
"S62: यदि गला बसेमा, उल्टी गर्न प्रेरित नगर्नुहोस् : तुरुन्त औषधी उपचार खोजी गर्नुहोस् र यो "
"कन्टेनर वा लेबुल देखाउनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:208
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S63: In case of accident by inhalation: remove casualty to fresh air and "
"keep at rest"
msgstr "S63: श्वासप्रश्वासद्वारा दुर्घटना भएमा: ताजा हावामा राख्नुहोस् र आराम दिनुहोस्"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:209
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S64: If swallowed, rinse mouth with water ( only if the person is conscious )"
msgstr "S64: यदि गला बसेमा, पानीले मुख खकाल्नुहोस् ( मान्छे होसमा हुँदा मात्र )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:234
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R1: Explosive when dry"
msgstr "R1: सुख्खा हुँदा मात्र विस्फोटक हुन्छ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:235
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"R2: Risk of explosion by shock, friction, fire or other sources of ignition"
msgstr "R2: झड्का, घर्षण, आगो वा प्रज्वलनको अन्य संसाधानद्वारा विस्फोटकको जोखिम"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:236
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"R3: Extreme risk of explosion by shock, friction, fire or other sources of "
"ignition"
msgstr "R3: झड्का, घर्षण, आगो वा प्रज्वलनको अन्य संसाधानद्वारा विस्फोटकको अत्यधिक जोखिम"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:237
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R4: Forms very sensitive explosive metallic compounds"
msgstr "R4: धेरै संवेदनशील विस्फोटक मेटालिक अवयव बनाउँदछ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:238
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R5: Heating may cause an explosion"
msgstr "R5: तापले एउटा विस्फोटक गर्न सक्छ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:239
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R6: Explosive with or without contact with air"
msgstr "R6: हावासँगको सम्पर्क सहित वा विहिन विस्फोटक"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:240
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R7: May cause fire"
msgstr "R7: आगो लाग्न सक्छ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:241
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R8: Contact with combustible material may cause fire"
msgstr "R8: उत्तेजनशील सामग्रीसँगको सम्पर्कले आगो उत्पन्न गर्न सक्छ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:242
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R9: Explosive when mixed with combustible material"
msgstr "R9: उत्तेजनशील सामग्रीसँग मिश्रण गर्दा विस्फोटन हुन सक्छ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:243
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R10: Flammable"
msgstr "R10: प्रज्वलणीय"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:244
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R11: Highly flammable"
msgstr "R11: उच्च प्रज्वलणीय"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:245
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R12: Extremely flammable"
msgstr "R12: तीव्र रूपमा प्रज्वलणीय"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:246
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R14: Reacts violently with water"
msgstr "R14: पानीसँग कठिन रूपमा प्रतिक्रिया गर्दछ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:247
msgctxt ""
